# Harness-written run trees carry live canary tokens, worker hostnames, and
# in-cluster Service DNS. Archive them under .unpublished/tenant-results/.
# Aggregates (FACTS.md, README.md) stay tracked. To publish a redacted tree
# deliberately: git add -f results/<arm>/<run-id>
